{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc.md","title":"CTL 的两域变量翻译正确性","display":"thm-ctl-fo2-tc — CTL 的两域变量翻译正确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc","aliases":["29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc"],"display":"thm-ctl-fo2-tc — CTL 的两域变量翻译正确性","depends_on":["[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","[[29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]","[[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]","[[29-df-fo-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem14.29 and proof, p.238, scan253","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 扫描253陈述及证明已读；显式语法接口与完整归纳论证为本地重建"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ctl-fo2-tc — CTL 的两域变量翻译正确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cef4708b7fffcfcb\" href=\"?note=cef4708b7fffcfcb\" title=\"29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc\">29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4d41d3758401af0\" href=\"?note=f4d41d3758401af0\" title=\"29-df-ctl-tc-translation\">29-df-ctl-tc-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem14.29 and proof, p.238, scan253"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 扫描253陈述及证明已读；显式语法接口与完整归纳论证为本地重建"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\">\\(K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\)</span> 为非空有限 Kripke 结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K\">\\(\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathcal C_k\">\\(c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k\">\\(\\varepsilon_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k,x,y,Z,\\mathcal F_k^{x,y},T_c^z\">\\(\\tau_k,x,y,Z,\\mathcal F_k^{x,y},T_c^z\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f4d41d3758401af0\" href=\"?note=f4d41d3758401af0\" title=\"29-df-ctl-tc-translation\">29-df-ctl-tc-translation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in Z\">\\(z\\in Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_K\">\\(\\mathfrak A_K\\)</span> 在下式构造为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k\">\\(\\tau_k\\)</span> 结构，关系解释的次序与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k\">\\(\\tau_k\\)</span> 一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to S\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to S\\)</span> 为赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_K\\coloneqq\\langle S,R,P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A_K\\coloneqq\\langle S,R,P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\left(T_c^z\\in\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau_k]\\land\\mathrm{FV}(T_c^z)\\subseteq\\{z\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\left(T_c^z\\in\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau_k]\\land\\mathrm{FV}(T_c^z)\\subseteq\\{z\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\forall\\beta\\in S^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\;\\left(\\mathfrak A_K\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}T_c^z[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\beta(z))=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\forall\\beta\\in S^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\;\\left(\\mathfrak A_K\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}T_c^z[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\beta(z))=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem14.29 的陈述和全部证明段已在印刷238页、扫描253核对；本条为可复查的规范代码版本。这里只计域变量名字，TC 绑定也包含在目标文法内；没有隐藏第三个域变量，也没有布尔变量。</p>\n<p>本地归纳：常量、原子、否定与合取直接由真值子句成立。EX 使用 Kripke 每点有后继，将存在一个后继等同于存在有该后继的无限路径。EU、EB 使用前一原子的关系级刻画；归纳假设说明 Γ_c 的 TC 体恰好定义 R 的“源点满足 ε(c)”限制，Δ_c 恰好表示该限制中从当前点返回自身的非空路径。因此递归翻译的两种分支与路径真值逐项一致，包括在当前点满足 until 的零步情形。</p>\n<p>文法及自由变量也同步归纳：T_c^z 只有 z 可能自由；Γ_c(u,v) 的体内 x,y 都被 TC 绑定，其自由端点只来自 u,v；Δ_c^z 的另一个变量由存在量词绑定。所有构造的变量名字只来自 {x,y}，嵌套公式通过局部作用域复用名字。规范 AX、AF、AG、AU、AB 由布尔对偶继承正确性；EG 的 EB(⊥,c) 路径条件恰为所有位置均满足 c。</p>\n<p>有限性是 EB 的“无限路径必有非空环”步骤所必需。这里确认的是显式有限 Kripke 结构上的陈述与归纳证明；不把 Theorem14.29 升级为符号化状态空间输入的成本定理，也不由此宣称已核验 Fact14.30 的一般 CTL* 构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc","status":"resolved","id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-tc-translation","status":"resolved","id":"f4d41d3758401af0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构；$\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。$c\\in\\mathcal C_k$，$\\varepsilon_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构；$\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。$c\\in\\mathcal C_k$，$\\varepsilon_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-tc-translation","status":"resolved","id":"f4d41d3758401af0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_k,x,y,Z,\\mathcal F_k^{x,y},T_c^z$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]；$z\\in Z$。$\\mathfrak A_K$ 在下式构造为 $\\tau_k$ 结构，关系解释的次序与 $\\tau_k$ 一致。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to S$ 为赋值；$\\mathrm{FV}$ 及 $\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}$ 采用 [[29-df-fo-tc]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k,x,y,Z,\\mathcal F_k^{x,y},T_c^z","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_K\\coloneqq\\langle S,R,P_0,\\ldots,P_{k-1}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\left(T_c^z\\in\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\tau_k]\\land\\mathrm{FV}(T_c^z)\\subseteq\\{z\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall c\\in\\mathcal C_k\\;\\forall z\\in Z\\;\\forall\\beta\\in S^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\;\\left(\\mathfrak A_K\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}T_c^z[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ V_s^K(\\varepsilon_k(c),\\beta(z))=1\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":3038,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]、[[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]、[[29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc]] — EU/EB 的路径与环刻画、显式两变量翻译及正确性"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc]]"}],"outgoing":["8cb839e87a64afa7","f0b39f920854da20","76daeadc9ac4f409","cef4708b7fffcfcb","f4d41d3758401af0","98a7b2fe455fde6b"]}